# INVWINPS.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY, run with
# /CFG:PANEB.CFG, a settings file that is not there, on the sixty items
# of TEST/KEYS/RLLONG.REQ, each odd one installed in the even one before
# it (TEST/KEYS/PANEB.REQ): thirty assemblies, more than a page, each of
# one part.  Items > Assemblies counts them; Take out from the parts
# beside the first leaves it no assembly, and the assemblies, fetched
# again, are counted again, one fewer, and take the focus.  In add mode
# the twelve assemblies after the first are chosen, the first staying
# the focus row, which the parts follow; Install in installs them all in
# it, and its parts, fetched again as its row stays, are counted again:
# more than a page, as F6 shows.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINPS.SNP is its snapshot; TEST/framchk.py checks
# it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-I A
S LONG
K F6 ALT-C T
T A1
K ENTER
S COUNTED
K SHIFT-F8 DOWN SPACE
K SHIFT-DOWN SHIFT-DOWN SHIFT-DOWN SHIFT-DOWN SHIFT-DOWN SHIFT-DOWN
K SHIFT-DOWN SHIFT-DOWN SHIFT-DOWN SHIFT-DOWN SHIFT-DOWN
K UP UP UP UP UP UP UP UP UP UP UP UP SPACE
S PICKED
K ALT-C I
T 6
K ENTER
S INTO
K F6
S BIGGER
K ALT-F X
